WEBVTT

00:22:58.538 --> 00:23:01.746
Probably more women coming in

00:23:01.746 --> 00:23:06.746
and more women using their feminine
qualities rather than trying to ape

00:23:06.746 --> 00:23:09.788
the male qualities of the existing system

00:23:10.621 --> 00:23:13.829
and which, quote unquote, feminine
qualities do you think are most important

00:23:13.829 --> 00:23:14.829
in leadership?

00:23:15.538 --> 00:23:21.246
It's very important to be understanding,
to be intuitive,

00:23:22.246 --> 00:23:25.579
to be patient and to be compassionate.

00:23:26.913 --> 00:23:30.913
And is your hope that we continue seeing
those as feminine qualities